    "reference_solution": "def is_prime(n):\n    if n < 2:\n        return False\n    for d in range(2, int(n ** 0.5) + 1):\n        if n % d == 0:\n            return False\n    return True\n\nprint(\"prime\" if is_prime(int(input())) else \"not prime\")\n",
